  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Halve potatoes and place on the lined oven tray, cut-side down. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Bake until golden and tender, 40-45 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-664f03082ae3a5972f828c44-e63141a4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Roughly chop tomato and brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and the 1/2 the garlic over mediumhigh heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer to a small bowl. Stir in yoghurt. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-664f03082ae3a5972f828c44-6d579fd4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potatoes have 10 mins remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook black beans, onion, and carrot until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Add spicy taco seasoning (spice blend is hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat) and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in the water, passata, vegetable stock powder, brown sugar and butter and cook until thickened, 3-4 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-664f03082ae3a5972f828c44-24fb0802.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato, the honey and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide jacket potatoes between plates. Top with bean chilli and garlic yoghurt. Drizzle with mild chipotle sauce.\n• Serve with honey balsamic tomato salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-664f03082ae3a5972f828c44-1d9f6b31.jpeg"
    }
  ]
